OL,3,GNEWSAGreat-nephew's DNA helps identify
OL,4,AWW1 soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soldier has been identified nearly
OL,7,F110 years after he went missing during
OL,8,FWorld War One by using a DNA sample
OL,9,Fprovided by a great-nephew.
OL,11,FPte George McIntosh served in the 8th
OL,12,FBattalion Bedfordshire Regiment after
OL,13,Fworking as a gardener and florist.
OL,15,FHe was killed in action on 19 April
OL,16,F1917 and was buried on Tuesday
OL,17,Falongside one of his comrades at Loos
OL,18,FBritish Cemetery Extension in
OL,19,FLoos-en-Gohelle, northern France.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
