OL,3,GNEWSAGreat-nephew's DNA helps identify
OL,4,AWW1 soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeff MacIntosh, his great-nephew, who
OL,7,Ftravelled from North Carolina in the US
OL,8,Fto be at the ceremony, said the DNA
OL,9,Finvestigation had "allowed us to
OL,10,Fexplore his life, understand what his
OL,11,Floss meant to his mother and family,
OL,12,Fand gain a better understanding of
OL,13,FWW1".
